# Interface-Forever is a packager-only directive (the game client itself
# only reads the line above) that tells BigWigsMods/packager this addon
# also supports the Forever flavor on CurseForge. 16001 is not a real
# interface number - it's the placeholder every currently-published Forever
# addon uses (confirmed via RareScanner's actual Forever-flavored upload),
# because the packager's own Forever detection only recognizes a 5-digit
# "16xxx" value and doesn't know this beta's real 6-digit numbering. Do not
# "fix" this to match tools/deploy.sh's real interface number - that number
# fails the packager's validation outright (see release-process notes).
## Interface: @toc-version-forever@
## Interface-Forever: 16001
## Title: WabaUI
## Notes: Recolor and darken standard UI panels, the minimap, action bars, and chat frames
## Author: WabaGagi
## Version: 0.4.2
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1703216
## SavedVariables: WabaUISettingsDB

Core.lua
Skin.lua
Minimap.lua
